  "identifier": "napari",
  "name": "napari",
  "description": "Fast, interactive, multi-dimensional image viewer for Python. The standard viewer for bio-imaging and computational pathology workflows — supports n-dimensional arrays, layered rendering (images, labels, points, shapes, tracks), and a large plugin ecosystem covering fluorescence microscopy, histopathology, cell segmentation, and medical imaging. Backed by the Chan Zuckerberg Initiative.",
