  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The standard Python viewer for bio-imaging and computational pathology research. 2,652 stars, 496 forks, CZI-backed, BSD-3-Clause. Not a clinical DICOM platform — its strength is multi-dimensional bio-image exploration and a rich plugin ecosystem (napari-hub) covering histopathology, fluorescence microscopy, and cell segmentation. Natural companion to OMERO (data management), PathML, and HistoLab (analysis) already in MACH. Essential for any team building Python-native bio-imaging or computational pathology pipelines.",
